{"type":"system","subtype":"commands_changed","commands":[{"name":"emem:shared_fact (MCP)","description":"Turn something you observed into a signed record with one address, so another agent reads the same bytes instead of your summary of them. The core loop: ground it, read it, mint a citation.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:verify_claim (MCP)","description":"Someone handed you a number, a token, or an assertion. Find out whether it resolves, whether the signature holds, and whether anyone signed a different value at the same address, without trusting the party who gave it to you or this responder.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:carry_state (MCP)","description":"Your context is ending, or the work is going to another agent. Collapse what matters into citations that survive the boundary, instead of a summary that loses the ability to be checked.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:a2a_exchange (MCP)","description":"The agent-to-agent door: find peers, read your inbox, send a signed message, hand over a citation another agent resolves and verifies without trusting you. Answers with the concrete call sequence for the exchange you name.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:flood_history (MCP)","description":"Long-term flood/inundation history at a place, classified from JRC Global Surface Water v1.4 (1984–2021).","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:air_quality_now (MCP)","description":"Current PM2.5 / PM10 / NO2 / O3 / SO2 / CO at a place, classified against WHO 2021 AQG ladder.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:urban_heat (MCP)","description":"Urban-heat-island assessment from MODIS LST day/night and indices.urban_canopy_index, with cooling-potential note.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:place_summary (MCP)","description":"Quick characterisation: landcover (ESA WorldCover), elevation (Cop-DEM), greenness (NDVI), current temperature.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:compare_places (MCP)","description":"Cosine similarity over the geotessera 128-D embedding, with dominant-band rationale.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:forest_loss (MCP)","description":"Hansen Global Forest Change v1.13 layers: tree cover 2000, year of loss (2001–2025), gain mask.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:coastal_eutrophication (MCP)","description":"SDG 14.1.1a coastal-eutrophication first-pass: floating-algae index + chlorophyll proxy + turbidity + SST.","argumentHint":""},{"name":"emem:carbon_uptake_anomaly (MCP)","description":"GPP anomaly z-score from MOD17A2H trajectory (current 8-day vs same-DOY climatology).","argumentHint":""}],"uuid":"ed3cfb52-ccca-4357-a1fa-a0754e1020e5","session_id":"0db6b3ad-8059-51a6-bd74-2d7a97faf986"}
